^pid1: my pid is 1$
^-- orphan adopted \(its parent is now 1\)$
# the orphan (pid 3) now has parent 1
^ +3 +1 S +pid1$
^-- orphan has exited, but PID 1 has not waited for it$
# it ended, and is a zombie under PID 1
^ +3 +1 Z +pid1$
^PID 1 collected 1 finished child\(ren\)$
^-- after PID 1 waited for any child$
